id: pm-3mefuq
title: Preserve structured test recovery and refuse comment-only verification
description: "Final replay and CodeRabbit review identify three connected boundaries: structured command/cmd metadata must remain intact, empty command identities require a command template, and assignment-only commands with trailing shell comments must not pass as tests. Preserve literal delimiters and commands on later lines."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
