author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 30
parent: pm-t2dqzijokl31
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "Preserved structured command/cmd metadata, rebuilt command-required templates for empty identities, and scanned assignment/comment-only programs without swallowing later-line executables."
expected_result: "Exact explicit retries preserve test metadata and delimiters, missing commands never receive executable retries, and syntactically empty assignment/comment programs cannot create false pass evidence."
actual_result: "81 linked regressions pass with durable receipts, including actual CLI retry replay, timeout retention, literal commas, empty-command templates, no-write legacy refusal and later-line execution. Source quality, type checks, lint and generated contracts pass; exact-head hosted checks and review remain merge conditions."
