comments[5]:
  - created_at: "2026-10-23T12:03:56.016Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "text=Duplicate check: request-specific search, live open and in_progress lists, and a fresh strict all-status read of3076 readable items with no omissions found only the completed parent delivery for this newly observed boundary. The SDK probe returns command=node --version with timeout_seconds=90 embedded in the command string; add a real CLI replay regression before changing the recovery primitive."
  - created_at: "2026-10-23T12:06:36.851Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Negative control: after requesting full SDK detail in the fixture, the real replay regression fails against the unchanged implementation because the stored command includes the timeout metadata. Preserve explicit command/cmd entries as structured add values; use add-json only for bare shell commands. Add a literal comma-bearing shell command round trip as the contrasting contract."
  - created_at: "2026-10-23T12:11:55.173Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "CodeRabbit review5627890219 independently confirmed structured metadata loss and added two valid boundaries: empty command identities and assignment-only commands followed by shell comments. Address all three in this active child. Parse explicit structured entries using the existing SDK CSV grammar, retaining non-empty entries exactly and rebuilding command-required templates from the remaining fields. Skip only whitespace/comments after assignments; newline executables remain executable. The prior pushed head completed all emitted checks with no missing/pending required contexts; merge remains blocked on actionable review threads. Optional Sourcery quota and Greptile trial limitations are not approvals."
    edited_at: "2026-10-23T12:12:22.643Z"
  - created_at: "2026-10-23T12:15:52.047Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Full review triage: all three inline CodeRabbit findings are accepted and covered. The non-inline out-of-scope warning is declined: the user explicitly requested latest pm-changelog consumption and multiple related PM items in one PR; pm-4pzw7i owns the observed host SDK census gap and is linked in the PR body. Generator ownership remains upstream. CodeRabbit reported an ESLint install/registry failure; local declared-dependency lint passes and the hosted static check passed on the previous head, so no dependency or bot-configuration workaround is justified."
  - created_at: "2026-10-23T12:17:51.946Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final local verification: the linked recovery/integration command passes39 cases and assignment admission passes42 cases, both with recorded pass receipts. Source/static quality passes with100 percent source/export/member docstrings; type checking, changed-file lint, SDK surface, error catalog and agent capability checks pass. The real replay preserves command and timeout separately for command/cmd, retains bare literal commas, and uses templates for empty commands. Assignment/comment-only registration and legacy execution refuse without durable writes; real commands after comments execute successfully. Exact revised-head hosted coverage and renewed reviews remain merge conditions."
